## How to resolve conflicts safely

| Type of conflict | Usual resolution |
|---|---|
| **Docs** (`egg-datadog-metrics.md`) | Keep **both** sections. Don't delete develop's text. |
| **Enumerations** (`ActionEnumeration.php`, `ComponentEnumeration.php`) | Keep develop's new values **and** the branch's new values. Watch for duplicate constants. |
| **Same function changed on both sides** (`EggWorkflowMeter.php`) | Read both intents. Combine them. If unsure, **stop and ask the branch owner**. |
| **Tests** | Keep both sets of tests |

Never resolve by blindly choosing "ours" or "theirs" for a whole file.

