## If something goes wrong

| Situation | Fix |
|---|---|
| Rebase gets messy mid-way | `git rebase --abort`. Everything goes back to how it was. |
| Pushed but it's wrong | Restore from the backup: `git push --force-with-lease origin backup/RD-11640-before-rebase:Feat/RD-11640` |
| `--force-with-lease` rejected | Someone pushed in the meantime. **Stop**, fetch, and talk to them. |

